# Workflow

- User runs every install/CLI command; give one `cmd.exe`/`Cmder` block, wait for paste-back.
- Never PowerShell. Prefer: `cmd.exe /c "cd /d C:\Users\a-maghami\Desktop\shop && …"`
- Commit/push/PR only when user asks.
- Touch only files needed for the task; no drive-by refactors or unsolicited markdown.
- Prefer `@` specific files over whole-repo scans.
- New chat for unrelated tasks (history burns tokens).
